 "remarks": "Spacious 1 bed, 1 & 1/2 bath condo in a desirable, well maintained luxury high rise. Large living room, adjacent dining room, private terrace. Dining room easily converts to bedroom or study. Abundant closet space, including large California Closet in Bedroom. Great Mid City location. Across the street from the Tully Center's medical facilities, health club and cafe. Minutes to Downtown. 24 Hour Doorman building. 1 underground parking space. Visitor parking in lot behind building. Heat, hot water, and cooking gas are included in the HOA fee. New HVAC units in living room and bedroom. Apartment door will be updated and replaced prior to closing. Sale subject to Probate Court approval and is sold \"As Is\".",
